### Qualification probe exception

A blocked model is called only in a separate probe task that a human explicitly instructed, with a synthetic/docs-only fixture, where the orchestrator owns the claim, isolation and lifecycle, without direct push to main and without Issue/PR/merge/release permissions, and when failure results are preserved as raw observations. If any one of these is missing, the deny stays.

